<title>BOLIVIA: SOCCER-BOLIVIA BEAT URUGUAY 1-0 IN COPA AMERICA.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BOLIVIA BEAT URUGUAY 1-0 IN COPA AMERICA.</headline>
<dateline>LA PAZ 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bolivia beat Uruguay 1-0</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in a Copa America first round group B match on</p>
<p>Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Julio Cesar Baldivieso (30)</p>
<p>Final standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost,</p>
<p>goals for, goals against, points)</p>
<p> Bolivia	  3  3  0  0  4  0  9</p>
<p> Peru	     3  2  0  1  3  2  6</p>
<p> Uruguay	  3  1  0  2  2  2  3</p>
<p> Venezuela	3  0  0  3  0  5  0</p>
<p>Note: top two teams in each group plus the two best</p>
<p>third-placed teams qualify for the quarter-finals.</p>
<p>Bolivia and Peru qualified.</p>
</text>
